msgstr ""
"\"%(value)s\" qiymati noto‘g‘ri formatga ega. U HH: MM [: ss [.uuuuuu]] "
"formatida bo‘lishi kerak."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"“%(value)s” value has the correct format (HH:MM[:ss[.uuuuuu]]) but it is an "
